  "body": "If you try to federate up and join a remote room but your server is not contactable (or has the wrong signing key), you get an ambiguous M_UNKNOWN error.  This is a common failure mode - we should say clearly what actually the problem is and help guide the admin into fixing it.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-310)\n\n(Reported by @ara4n)",
